+ * {@link AbstractHttpWebServiceMessageSender} (CVE-2026-40999). Peer-supplied
+ * ({@link UriSource#REMOTE}) WS-Addressing reply destinations must not be able to reach
+ * loopback, link-local or RFC 1918 private IPv4 literals, mitigating SSRF, while
+ * application-controlled destinations keep the legacy behavior.
